is made to others’ work and that the thesis contains 202 pages, 56 figures, and 29 tables.
I declare that the Chapter 4 of this dissertation has been recently published in
the Journal Applied Mathematical Modelling as "Do we have enough data? Robust
reliability via uncertainty quantification" co-authored by E. Patelli (my primary
supervisor) and M. Broggi (my secondary supervisor) and it is an extension of a work
