The X i notation indicates the set of all variables except Xpiq. The above variance decomposition shows how the variance of the model output can be decomposed into terms
attributable to each input, as well as the interaction effects between them. Together,
all terms sum to the total variance of the model output.
Sobol’s indices
A variance-based statistic, commonly referred to as the first order sensitivity coefficient,
quantifies the (additive) effect of each input factor on the model output as follows [76]:
Si “
