th line, generator or transformer failure). The overload severity function for the line j
under the contingency k and grid-environment condition ζ is SOL,j pCk, ζq; SLV,bpCk, ζq
is the low voltage severity of the node (bus) b; SV I pCk, ζq is the voltage instability
severity function, defined for the whole system under contingency k, PpCj |Ck, ζq is a
probabilistic indicator for cascading failures (i.e. probability of face failure Cj after
