7.5 Discussion
In this chapter, the sensitivity of a cascading failures model for power grids has been
analysed. Variance-based global sensitivity analysis indices, i.e. Sobol’s indices, have
been computed to reveal which among the uncertainty sources is affecting the most the
variances of the cascading failure model output. The Morris screening indices are also
obtained and compared to variance based indices to improve confidence in the results
151

