differs from a later estimate) employing eligibility traces to carry out backups over nsteps and not just over one step [142]. Details on SARSA(λ) are provided in Algorithm
4 in the Appendix.
8.4 Case study
A scaled-down power grid case study is used to test the RL decision making framework.
The grid includes: 2 controllable generators; 5 cables for the power transmission; 2
